<urn:usf:schema:bootstrap-carrier-adoption-receipt:1> <urn:usf:predicate:authorityRule> "The receipt is a durable HistoricalCarrierObservation only. It represents successful exact carrier verification plus a point-in-time current-postimage observation at one durable local Git basis; later current movement never invalidates its historical parent, commit, tree or path-effect classification. completionState is not-observed, evidenceState is not-admitted, proofState is not-evaluated, ordinaryPermissionState is unchanged and runtimeState is unchanged. Receipt digest membership excludes only receiptDigest itself and binds every other present field. Every array and derived set digest uses the exact source, projection, subset, member schema, UTF-8 byte order and canonical JSON preimage declared by bootstrap-carrier-derived-sets:1, never execution order. A refusal emits only the command error schema, writes no receipt and grants no adoption." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
