<urn:usf:schema:bootstrap-carrier-validation-result:1> <urn:usf:predicate:authorityRule> "A tracked carrier receipt contains only passing normalized historical-validation facts: exact carrier basis, graph-derived validation and exact closed command/dependency identities, configured timeout/grace, timedOut false, lastTerminationSignal not-used, exitCode zero, outcome pass and an empty UTF-8-bytewise ordered failure set. commandDigest is SHA-256 over the canonical JSON commandTokens array. dependencyDigest and failureSetDigest use the exact membership rules in bootstrap-carrier-derived-sets:1. Raw stdout, stderr, timestamps, wall-clock durations and TAP timing remain transient ignored observations and never enter tracked bytes. Sort aggregate validationResults by validationIri using UTF-8 byte order and derive validationResultSetDigest over the complete canonical array." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
