<urn:usf:canonicalization:bootstrap-carrier-json:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalizationRule> "Validate the declared closed value schema; serialize JSON objects with keys in unsigned UTF-8 byte order, arrays in their field-specific declared order, strings with JSON escaping, integers as minimal base-10 digits, booleans and null as their lowercase JSON tokens, and no insignificant whitespace or trailing newline. SHA-256 digests use lowercase hexadecimal prefixed by sha256:. Unknown keys, duplicate keys, duplicate set members, invalid UTF-8, floats, negative zero and noncanonical values refuse." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
