<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-path-effect-sets:1> <urn:usf:predicate:sortKey> "repositoryPath:UTF-8-byte-order" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-path-effect-sets:1> <urn:usf:predicate:digestRule> "scopedPathEffectSetDigest is SHA-256 of the canonical JSON array containing every and only pathEffects member exactly once. includedPathEffectSetDigest is SHA-256 of the canonical JSON array obtained by retaining those same complete member objects whose disposition is included. excludedPathEffectSetDigest is the analogous complete-object array whose disposition is excluded. All three arrays sort by repositoryPath using unsigned UTF-8 byte order, including the canonical empty array when a subset has no members. The scoped array must equal the disjoint union of the included and excluded subsets and counts must match the selected path-effect declarations." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-postimage-sets:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CanonicalDigestMembership> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
