<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-postimage-sets:1> <urn:usf:predicate:sortKey> "repositoryPath:UTF-8-byte-order" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-postimage-sets:1> <urn:usf:predicate:digestRule> "carrierPostimageSetDigest is SHA-256 of a canonical JSON array with one projection for every selected pathEffects member, ordered by repositoryPath: repositoryPath, disposition, carrierPostimageState and, exactly when present, carrierPostimageDigest and carrierPostimageMode. observedCurrentPostimageSetDigest is SHA-256 of the analogous every-selected-member array containing repositoryPath, disposition, observedCurrentPostimageState, observedCurrentnessDisposition and, exactly when present, observedCurrentPostimageDigest and observedCurrentPostimageMode. Excluded projections remain classified historical observations and do not enter adopted-subject or included-currentness authority." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-adopted-subject-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CanonicalDigestMembership> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-adopted-subject-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:sourceField> "adoptedSubjects" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-adopted-subject-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:memberSchema> <urn:usf:schema:bootstrap-carrier-adopted-subject:1> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-adopted-subject-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:digestRule> "adoptedSubjects must equal every and only adoptedWork and adoptedCarrierIntent object derived from the selected adoption, with kind, IRI and independently queried subjectResourceDigest. Sort by kind then IRI using unsigned UTF-8 byte order and derive adoptedSubjectSetDigest from the canonical JSON array of complete objects." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-validation-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CanonicalDigestMembership> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-validation-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:sourceField> "validationResults" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-validation-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:memberSchema> <urn:usf:schema:bootstrap-carrier-validation-result:1> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-validation-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:digestRule> "validationResults must contain every and only validation IRI declared by the selected adoption, each once, sorted by validationIri using unsigned UTF-8 byte order. Verify each normalizedResultDigest over its complete object excluding only normalizedResultDigest, then derive validationResultSetDigest over the canonical JSON array of the complete objects including normalizedResultDigest. Within each result, failureSetDigest is SHA-256 of the canonical JSON failureIdentities string array sorted by unsigned UTF-8 byte order; successful receipts require the exact empty array. dependencyDigest is SHA-256 of the canonical JSON dependencyMembers array of complete bootstrap-carrier-validation-dependency objects sorted by kind then identity using unsigned UTF-8 byte order. dependencyMembers must equal exactly bootstrap-carrier-validation-dependencies:1, including the carrier tree/test/input projections, authority/confinement/tool members and authenticated complete lock-closed read-only package mount; no caller member is accepted." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-nonclaim-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CanonicalDigestMembership> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-nonclaim-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:sourceField> "nonClaims" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:digest-membership:bootstrap-carrier-nonclaim-set:1> <urn:usf:predicate:digestRule> "nonClaims must equal every and only nonClaim literal directly declared on the selected carrier adoption, with exact UTF-8 bytes, no normalization or caller additions. Sort the strings by unsigned UTF-8 byte order and derive nonClaimSetDigest from the canonical JSON array." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:rule:bootstrap-carrier-aggregate-currentness:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CurrentnessAggregationRule> <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:rule:bootstrap-carrier-aggregate-currentness:1> <urn:usf:predicate:version> "1" <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:rule:bootstrap-carrier-aggregate-currentness:1> <urn:usf:predicate:pathRule> "For each selected path, exact-present means both carrier and observed current postimages are present with identical SHA-256 digest and Git mode; exact-absent means both are absent; missing means carrier is present and observed current is absent; unexpected-present means carrier is absent and observed current is present; divergent means both are present and either digest or mode differs. No other per-path disposition is valid." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
<urn:usf:rule:bootstrap-carrier-aggregate-currentness:1> <urn:usf:predicate:aggregateRule> "Evaluate every and only included path effect, ordered by repositoryPath only for canonicalization. The aggregate is current iff the included set is nonempty and every included member is exact-present or exact-absent; otherwise it is reconstructable after the raw carrier object and included postimage verification succeeds. Excluded members never improve or degrade this aggregate. Apply this exact rule once to the receipt's recorded currentObservationBasisCommit/tree and independently to the command result's newly derived liveCurrentnessBasisCommit/tree." <urn:usf:graph:integration> .
